Warning [L0152] (divergent_state_paths): `handle` ends in state `Joined` on one path and `Detached` on another.
  --> tests/ui_lint/task_state_diverges.jet:3:5
    |
  3 |     if {
    |     ^^
 Why: Typestate (D-STATE1, D-FACT-FLOW1): after two paths meet, a state holds only when both paths agree — here they do not, so the value is untracked from this point and later state checks on it stay silent.
 Fix: Bring both paths to the same state before they meet, or do the work that needs the state inside the path that reaches it.
